# PAM configuration for the Metis session lock screen.
#
# Installed to /etc/pam.d/metis. The compositor authenticates the logged-in
# user against this stack when they unlock the screen. It defers to the
# system's standard interactive-auth and account stacks by default, so password
# unlock works out of the box.
#
# Optional biometrics / security keys (uncomment after installing packages and
# enrolling — see docs/USER_GUIDE.md):
#   Ubuntu: fprintd libpam-fprintd ; libpam-u2f + pamu2fcfg
# auth sufficient pam_u2f.so cue origin=pam://metis
# auth sufficient pam_fprintd.so
@include common-auth
@include common-account
